# Committed deliberately despite apps/web/.gitignore's blanket `.env*`
# rule (see that file's own "can opt-in for committing if needed" note).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL is a public URL, not a secret -- see
# src/lib/api-client.ts's and next.config.ts's own header comments --
# so there's nothing here that needs to stay out of version control.
# Next.js loads this file automatically for `next build` (production
# builds only; `next dev` still falls back to api-client.ts's own
# localhost:8787 default via .env.local or no override at all).
#
# Points at apps/api's real deployed Worker (see apps/api/wrangler.toml
# for the account/subdomain this was claimed under). Must stay in sync
# by hand if that Worker is ever renamed or moved to a custom domain --
# nothing derives this value automatically from apps/api's own config.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://hiring-signals-api.teycircoder14.workers.dev
